{"c":[{"id":"f2d0dc693149a215","sum":"Issue #129: BenchLM has no effort spellings. An unmatched effort is placed in memory from the stored row and neighbors; catalog.json stays hand-chosen. pick.py prints an author it cannot place and exits 0. SKILL.md is a thin caller. That placement is a sketch.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"152b5c9c8901dee0","sum":"Issue #129: BenchLM has no effort spellings. pick.py places an unmatched effort in memory from the stored row and its neighbors; catalog.json stays hand-chosen. Different efforts are not one row, and that placement is a sketch.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260923T215907Z-3b72c8c9f491a1f5","text":"Issue #129: effort-variant slugs must not make pick.py exit 2. Different efforts are not the same row. Synthetic in-memory placement is a sketch, not the decision.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260923T220855Z-f374d7ed9ff469c1","text":"BenchLM models.json has no effort spellings. Issue #129 places an unmatched effort in memory from the stored row and its neighbors; catalog.json stays the hand-chosen set.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"cca16e69e65a762f","sum":"pick.py prints an author spelling it cannot place and exits 0. An unmatched effort is placed in memory. SKILL.md stays a thin caller and does not choose on exit 2.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260923T221500Z-6ea911ac5a9d6f19","text":"choose-verification-model: an author spelling that cannot be placed is printed by the script and exits 0. The skill stays a thin caller and does not choose on exit 2.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260923T222445Z-2c0343a88b556f38","text":"OUTCOME: pick.py places unmatched effort spellings in memory. An author it cannot place is printed and the process exits 0. SKILL.md stays a thin caller.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"3978a5cedcf258cf","sum":"Tiers are hand-set trust, not score order, so do not derive one from neighbors. The catalog ranks the stem; the printed reviewer keeps the effort on its own spelling. Match BenchLM to Cursor by word sets: dashes, dots, cursor- prefixes, and -thinking.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"ddb89e6a53056b50","sum":"Tiers are hand-set and not monotone in score, so an unmatched effort placed from score-neighbors can land in S above its own A sibling. The catalog ranks the model stem. The printed reviewer keeps the effort on its own spelling.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260923T232506Z-24460cae37479591","text":"choose-verification-model place_effort takes tier from score-neighbors, but hand-set tiers are not monotone in score (kimi-k3-high A 77.87 > opus S 77.07): kimi-k3-low/medium place as S above their A sibling. Interpolated score is order-identical to just-beside-sibling.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260923T232738Z-a3126083d6a8469e","text":"choose-verification-model ranks the BenchLM model, not the effort. Catalog keys are stems and effort_encoded is false. The printed reviewer keeps the effort on the first --reviewer-models spelling of that model.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"28289b6c2ca70178","sum":"BenchLM slugs use dashes; Cursor stems use dots, cursor- prefixes, and -thinking. Match by word sets. Tiers are hand-set trust, not score order (kimi-k3 A above opus S). New models get a hand tier; do not derive a tier from score neighbors.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260924T004708Z-e3de1689c901c73d","text":"BenchLM slugs use dashes (gpt-5-6-sol); Cursor stems use dots (gpt-5.6-sol), cursor- prefixes, and -thinking. Direct scores[model_key(slug)] hits 2 of 12 live Task slugs; dots-to-dashes hits 9. BenchLM also has real -thinking slugs (claude-opus-4-5-thinking).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260924T133144Z-b367cb7052eb77f8","text":"choose-verification-model tiers are the operator's trust calibration, not a function of score (kimi-k3 A above opus S is intended). Never derive a tier from score neighbors. New models are onboarded with a hand tier the hour they ship; outside-author placement is not needed.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
